{
  "page_id": "EM-59",
  "section_header": "ENGINE MECHANICAL — Cylinder Block",
  "title": "ENGINE MECHANICAL — Cylinder Block",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Installation of rod bearing caps showing alignment and tightening of cap nuts",
      "labels": [
        "EM0071"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 5,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "5. INSTALL ROD BEARING CAPS"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Match the numbered cap with the numbered rod.",
        "(b) Align the marks punched on the rod and cap and tighten the cap nuts to specified torque alternately in two or three passes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Rod bearing cap nuts",
      "value": "450 kg-cm (33 ft-lb, 44 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) After tightening the caps, check that the crankshaft rotates smoothly."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Oil pump assembly installation showing pump mounting and bolt location",
      "labels": [
        "EM1402"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 27,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. MEASURE ROD THRUST CLEARANCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(See step 16 on page EM-43)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "7. INSTALL OIL PUMP ASSEMBLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Clean the oil pump.",
        "(b) Install the oil pump and holding bolt. Torque the bolt."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Oil pump holding bolt",
      "value": "220 kg-cm (16 ft-lb, 22 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) Install the oil pipe with gasket, lock washer and union bolt. Tighten the oil pipe nut and bolt."
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Oil pipe nut and union bolt",
      "value": "350 kg-cm (25 ft-lb, 34 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Oil pump drive shaft installation showing insertion technique",
      "labels": [
        "EM1404"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 52,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "8. INSTALL OIL PUMP DRIVE SHAFT"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "While turning the drive shaft, slowly insert so as not to damage the drive shaft bearing. Torque the bolt."
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Oil pump drive shaft bolt",
      "value": "130 kg-cm (9 ft-lb, 13 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Rear oil seal retainer installation diagram showing bolt positions and measurements at 20mm, 60mm, and 45mm intervals with nut and bolt length indicators",
      "labels": [
        "Nut",
        "Bolt Length",
        "mm"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 76,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "9. INSTALL REAR OIL SEAL RETAINER"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "10. INSTALL TIMING BELT CASE WITH WATER PUMP"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Position a new gasket on the cylinder block.",
        "(b) Install the timing belt case with eight bolts and two nuts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "8 mm bolt and nut",
      "value": "186 kg-cm (13 ft-lb, 18 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "10 mm bolt",
      "value": "375 kg-cm (27 ft-lb, 37 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "11. INSTALL OIL PAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(See page LU-7)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "12. INSTALL WATER BY-PASS PIPE"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "13. INSTALL FUEL HOSE SUPPORT"
    }
  ]
}
